---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){return ['en','es','pt','ru','tr'].map(lang=>({params:{lang}}))}
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use | Sourcing Ally" description="Terms for using the Sourcing Ally website and educational content." lang="en">
  <section class="legal-hero section-pad"><div class="container legal-wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Website policy</p><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p>Last reviewed: 13 August 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad section-light"><div class="container legal-body"><p>By using this website, you acknowledge that its pages provide general information about sourcing and importing from China. Reading the website does not create a sourcing, agency, advisory, legal, customs, tax, testing, or other professional relationship.</p><h2>Educational content</h2><p>Guides are written to help visitors ask better questions. Product, city, shipping, compliance, currency, holiday, and legal topics can change and may depend on the destination market, product, importer, and current rules. Check current requirements with an appropriately qualified professional before making a real transaction.</p><h2>Project discussions</h2><p>Information on this website does not constitute a quotation, guarantee, purchase order, service agreement, or promise that a particular supplier, product, price, timeline, certification, or outcome will be available. Any project scope, fee, responsibility, travel arrangement, or deliverable should be agreed separately.</p><h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Unless otherwise stated, the written structure, design, branding, and original materials on this website belong to Sourcing Ally or are used with permission. Do not reproduce or republish them without permission.</p><h2>External links and channels</h2><p>The website may link to external sources for education. Sourcing Ally does not control external websites, their availability, or their content. Email and WhatsApp are external communication channels and may have their own terms.</p><h2>Updates</h2><p>Sourcing Ally may update, remove, or reorganize website content. The website should not be treated as a permanent record of a supplier, rule, price, or availability.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
<style>.legal-hero{background:#f4f8ff}.legal-wrap{max-width:900px}.legal-wrap h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.7rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:0 0 18px}.legal-wrap>p:last-child{color:var(--muted)}.legal-body{max-width:850px}.legal-body h2{font-size:1.8rem;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:42px 0 10px}.legal-body p{color:#405069;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.85}</style>
